{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:df3286b9cb417648","name":"8D8 Smelting Operator","source":{"id":"source:reference-df3286b9cb417648","title":"8D8 Smelting Operator","revision":24305,"timestamp":"2024-10-29T23:46:36Z","sha256":"bbdbb421f0ee4e264e7bb679d365c59104ea0efe4c72a4ebc67fe48a425cdd81","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24305","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=8D8%20Smelting%20Operator&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-df3286b9cb417648","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed by Roche for use in the extreme environment of an industrial smelter, the 8D8 Smelting Operator is an efficient design. Though it lacks advanced processors, the 8D8 is incredibly strong. Its white kevlex coating allows it to easily withstand temperatures of up to 1,650 degrees Celsius. This special coating provides the 8D8 with a +20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extreme Heat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extreme_Heat"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Following the commercial failure of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["J9 Worker Drone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/J9_Worker_Drone","referenceId":"reference:96cc4232c1dbba92"},", the 8D8 Series was designed with a more ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," appearance in mind. The results are a mixed bag, with the 8D8's appearance being more skeletal than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},". In addition, the white finish of the kevlex coating does little to set ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"}," at ease. 8D8-Series Droids have simple personalities. They often develop an inferiority complex, resenting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," with more advanced processors. Older 8D8 models often resort to bullying their more advanced and socially adept kin.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["8D8 Smelting Operators can be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["8D8 Smelting Operator Statistics (CL 0)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["5th-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/5th-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +0\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 14 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href"